    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always had a soft spot for math, especially economics and basic math, which I use daily in my self-employed work. Though I didn’t go through formal schooling in math, I’ve learned through practical experience and reading. I find it useful, even if I don’t understand complex theories deeply. It’s like a tool I use, not a subject I study deeply.",
